==================================================
RESPONSIVE UI
==================================================

This game targets iPhone and iPad.

The interface must:
- respect Safe Area
- work in landscape
- scale correctly across different iPhone/iPad aspect ratios
- not stretch buttons or text
- keep touch targets large enough for mobile

==================================================
STYLE RULES
==================================================

Use:
- dark tactical panels
- thin borders
- subtle blue glow
- clean typography
- restrained animations
- slight hover/press feedback
- subtle UI transitions

Avoid:
- excessive neon
- excessive rounded cards
- huge gradients
- cartoon styling
- clutter
- unnecessary text

==================================================
ARCHITECTURE
==================================================

Keep the UI modular.

Suggested hierarchy:

LoginScene
├── Background
├── Branding
├── AuthenticationPanel
│   ├── LoginButton
│   ├── SignUpButton
│   ├── Divider
│   ├── GoogleButton
│   └── AppleButton
├── LoginForm
├── SignUpForm
├── SettingsButton
├── LegalLinks
└── VersionLabel

Create reusable UI components where appropriate.

